<title>UK: MEPC finance director to resign.</title>
<headline>MEPC finance director to resign.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British real estate group MEPC Plc said on Wednesday that its finance director Jim Beverdige was resigning from the company from February 28, 1997.</p>
<p>MEPC said Beveridge was resigning &quot;to pursue other business interests&quot;.</p>
<p>The company has yet to announce his successor.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
